          "reason": "Human individual/group and supervision categories do not directly map to AI execution. Exact identity controls, supervision, hardware and connectivity requirements are unspecified."
        },
        {
          "ids": ["2.14.preparation", "2.14.administration", "2.14.scoring", "2.14.analysis", "2.14.feedback"],
          "reason": "Administrator time is not supplied. Automated scoring means zero manual scoring time under EFPA's convention, not zero processing time."
        },
        {
