          "reason": "Scores and some AI responses are available, but EFPA-style interpretive-report availability, number, names, presentation, structure, context sensitivity, development, modifiability, transparency, content and recipients are not established."
        },
        {
          "ids": ["5.3"],
          "reason": "Supplier qualification requirements are not stated. A licence file and complete responsible-reuse rules were not found in the inspected material; this does not establish unavailable permission or prohibited reuse."
        },
        {
          "ids": ["6.1.2", "6.1.3.3", "6.1.6", "6.1.7"],
          "rating": 0,
          "reason": "No sufficient empirical construct summary, final-pool selection analysis, psychometric item-analysis methodology or results are supplied. Reviewer checks do not establish final error rates, discrimination or difficulty coverage."
        },
        {
          "ids": ["6.1.4", "6.2.3"],
          "rating": 0,
          "reason": "No translation or local-adaptation process is established; applicability remains unknown."
        },
        {
          "ids": ["6.2.5", "6.2.6", "6.2.8", "6.2.9", "6.2.10", "6.2.11", "6.2.12", "6.2.13"],
          "rating": 0,
          "reason": "Sufficient documentation of norms, precision, internal structure, external-variable validation, other-source validation, fairness, interpretive reports and inclusive language throughout the materials is unavailable."
        },
        {
          "ids": ["6.3.3", "6.3.6", "6.3.7", "6.3.8", "6.3.9"],
          "rating": 0,
          "reason": "Detailed norming, fair-use guidance, operational restrictions, technical support and supporting-reference instructions are unavailable. Public instructions and code do not establish complete coverage of these requirements."
        },
        {
          "ids": ["7.1.1", "7.1.4", "7.1.5", "7.1.7", "7.1.8"],
          "rating": 0,
          "reason": "Small marking-test files and content checks are insufficient to establish whole-system robustness, response usability, interface quality, overall item quality or overall technology-material quality. Known scoring sensitivities remain material."
